C VtF0 = Vtor[m/s]/Torque[10#19N*s/m3] factor for calculation of Vtor
C from torque toroidal rotation frequency for VTOR[10#19N*s/m3]
C		(Polevoi 22-AUG-96,Corrected 31-OCT-00,07-MAR-03)
C	Use: VTOR=VtF0*Torque
	VtF0=1.E9/(1.836*9.11*(RTOR+SHIF(j))*(2*Ndeut(j)+3*NTRIT(J)
     .	+4*NALF(J)+AIM1*NIZ1(J)+AIM2*NIZ2(J)+AIM3*NIZ3(J)+Nhydr(J)))


